Return exactly one Markdown document: the ADR itself, starting with its `# ADR — <title>` heading.
No commentary before or after it, no explanation of what you did, no code fence wrapping the whole
document (only the Mermaid/`text`/YAML blocks called for inside specific sections are fenced).
